<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Knee</h1>
<p>Weapon skill
Class: Assassin (guild level 35), Barbarian (guild level 35, up to 60%), Fighter (guild level 35, up to 60%), Thief (guild level 35, up to 90%)
Practising it needs dexterity 40.
Also taught by: Jojun the weapon master, in the Huashan Temple outside Xiyang (members of the Fighter, Thief and Assassin guilds only, from level 35)
</p><p>Usage: 
</p>
<pre> knee &lt;target&gt;
 knee              (whoever you are fighting)
</pre>
<p>This command will allow you to knee your opponent. It is more powerful when your
hands are free.
</p><p>Knee is a weapon skill; you must have practised it to knee. Each knee costs 2
endurance, and it lands best on someone who isn't fighting yet. You can knee
another player only when both of you have signed the book of blood.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
